+All remaining edges of G are defined as follows, with no other edges present:
+X union Z union {{u}} is a clique; X union {{v}} is a clique; {{u,v,w}} is a
+clique; Y union Z union {{u'}} is a clique; Y union {{v'}} is a clique; and
