+        "2^(2^o(k))*n^O(1) algorithms for VC-k Root under ETH when k grows; "
+        "the shipping distribution uses k=16 balanced planted rectangles on "
+        "36+36 bipartite vertices, and a maximal-biclique DPLL attack exhausts "
