+| demo | 2 | 2 | 1 | 12 | 28 | 2 |
+| easy | 16 | 8 | 4 | 46 | 336 | 72 |
+| medium | 26 | 13 | 6 | 71 | 806 | 1,523 |
+| **hard** | **36** | **16** | **7** | **94** | **1,312** | **8,383** |
+
+No preset was rejected by a deterministic gate. The oracle harness stopped at `easy` before scoring because of the account limit, so it did not accept or reject a level.
+
