+| G8 | pass | 120/120 invariance checks, 20/20 carried witnesses, 20/20 unrelated keys distinct |
+| G9(c) | pass | 1,312 chars, 328 token proxy, 32 atoms, 260 intended membership/union operations |
+
+## Oracle loop and G9 diagnostics
+
+No row below is a model failure: every call was an API error and therefore consumed zero scored attempts.
+
+| Arm | Preset | Seeds attempted | Models reached | Scored solved/attempts | Result |
+|---|---|---|---|---:|---|
+| bare | easy | 1685173993, 1176545551, 770164126, 1772334214 | GPT-5.6 Terra | 0/0 | four HTTP 403 key-limit errors |
