 - The renderer exposes the paper's gadget partition. This deliberately measures the hard biclique decomposition rather than recognition of the reduction gadget.
-- The hard preset is locally verified but **not releasable yet** because the required external oracle and G9 diagnostic arms have no scored attempts. Rerun all three after restoring OpenRouter quota.
